#lang scribble/manual

@title[#:tag "part-concepts" #:style '(toc grouper)]{Concepts}

This part explains how Animate works. Read it when a term or a design choice is
unclear. It is not a list of every function, and it is not a sequence of steps
you must finish before writing a program.

For code you can adapt, go to @secref["part-cookbook"]. For a first complete
animation, go to @secref["part-guide"].

